<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 20.71 to 5874.03.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite fell 0.28 to 365.23.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.03.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1206 to 1074.</p>
<p>Volume was 457,893,720, compared with 297,767,220 Monday.</p>
